WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.801
The idea of running off
with the circus

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.903
or the carnival
was always a very

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:07.841
strong fantasy for me,
 so I finally got to do it.

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:11.011
You just lean on your memory. 

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.580
I remember as a kid
 going to sideshows,

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:17.250
those memories are very strong
 because it was very scary

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.019
and very confusing, and it was 

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:21.488
it was like another world
 had come to visit us.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:25.291
Fall on your face. 

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.862
You can't always control
 all the situations you're in,

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:29.763
you can't control 

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:32.465
all the aspects of production,
 but what you can do

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:36.903
is make whatever you're doing
 authentic and and connected.

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:40.140
And if you get outside
 of worrying about the result

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:43.043
too much and worrying about,
 I mean, I'm conscientious.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.444
I want people
 to like the movies, 

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:47.380
but there's really a point
 where you have to let it go.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.516
You’ve got to stick your neck out,

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:52.552
and sometimes even
flirt with failure.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.487
Whether I do that or not, 

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:55.855
I like the idea.

